{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMPORTANT: BattleStick 2 isn't maintained anymore. Its successor, Stickforge, is set to release on Steam Q2 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/extras/logo.png?t=1741425522\" /><strong>FREE 2D MULTIPLAYER game!</strong> You fight in 2D arenas against stickmen characters controlled by REAL people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 20 players in online multiplayer battle modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play with up to 4 friends in Squad mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> TONS of stickman skins, weapons, throwables and headgear are available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Funny physics for stick figures with advanced controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full of memes and comical sounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique physics!</strong> During battles, you will be met with a number of unique and funny physics\u2019 situations. You will be able to chop off stickman bodies into pieces, jump unrealistically high and blow up dead stickman bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A diverse range of equipment items!</strong> You will purchase and experience different types of weapons, ranging from melee to ranged weapons; stickman skins of trendy memes, historical characters, and MORE! You will be able to take part in themed battles like Elves vs Orcs along with themed maps. It will be extended to a lot of themes, like Romans vs Gauls and Vikings vs Saxons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/extras/view_hippie.png?t=1741425522\" /><strong>We want you to laugh!</strong> Having fun and laughing hard is the most important part of the BattleStick franchise. Our secret sauce is to pair funny physics with any type of sound out of their original context, like a dog barking sound when you receive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So grab a drink, relax, and come play with us!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1402460?t=1741425522","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1402460?t=1741425522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741425522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741425522","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>New Game: Stickforge</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BattleStick 2 isn't maintained anymore. Instead I'm working on Stickforge, a fully moddable and improved version of BattleStick 2. You can find Stickforge on Steam too. It will be released Q2 2025!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/extras/920x430_alt.png?t=1741425522\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMPORTANT: BattleStick 2 isn't maintained anymore. Its successor, Stickforge, is set to release on Steam Q2 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/extras/logo.png?t=1741425522\" /><strong>FREE 2D MULTIPLAYER game!</strong> You fight in 2D arenas against stickmen characters controlled by REAL people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Up to 20 players in online multiplayer battle modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play with up to 4 friends in Squad mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> TONS of stickman skins, weapons, throwables and headgear are available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Funny physics for stick figures with advanced controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full of memes and comical sounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique physics!</strong> During battles, you will be met with a number of unique and funny physics\u2019 situations. You will be able to chop off stickman bodies into pieces, jump unrealistically high and blow up dead stickman bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A diverse range of equipment items!</strong> You will purchase and experience different types of weapons, ranging from melee to ranged weapons; stickman skins of trendy memes, historical characters, and MORE! You will be able to take part in themed battles like Elves vs Orcs along with themed maps. It will be extended to a lot of themes, like Romans vs Gauls and Vikings vs Saxons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/extras/view_hippie.png?t=1741425522\" /><strong>We want you to laugh!</strong> Having fun and laughing hard is the most important part of the BattleStick franchise. Our secret sauce is to pair funny physics with any type of sound out of their original context, like a dog barking sound when you receive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So grab a drink, relax, and come play with us!</h2>","developers":["NOLDO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/header.jpg?t=1741425522","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256798293,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256798293/movie480.mp4?t=1598940563","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256798293/movie_max.mp4?t=1598940563"},"name":"BattleStick 2 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256798293/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1598940563","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256798293/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1598940563","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256798293/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1598940563"}}],"name":"BattleStick 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or older<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i5-750<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 650M<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> just have any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Anything not pre-2000s should work fine. Even Karen's computer. Anyway, depending on the game mode (number of players in game) physics simulation can be power-intensive.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NOLDO"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"24 Sep, 2020"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402460/ss